        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In December 2021, we acquired Oak Street (as defined in Note 10 to our Financial Statements), which expanded our offerings to include real estate-focused products.",
        "start_character": 937,
        "end_character": 1100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The global market represents a large, and relatively untapped opportunity for many of our products that we believe will facilitate our pursuit of international expansion in the coming years, and position us to enter into less-developed markets where we can be a significant first-mover and play a key role in defining the markets.",
        "start_character": 34496,
        "end_character": 34826
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also believe the global nature of our investor base enables significant cross-selling opportunities between our products.",
        "start_character": 29859,
        "end_character": 29983
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide our employees with job-specific training and development opportunities, robust health and other wellness offerings, as well as a variety of quality-of-life benefits, including family planning resources.",
        "start_character": 49155,
        "end_character": 49373
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe through the disciplined expansion of our business, we can continue to develop our breadth of offerings and further our position as a leading solutions provider.",
        "start_character": 33018,
        "end_character": 33189
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have continued to grow our investor base and presence in the growing private markets and alternative asset management sector by emphasizing our disciplined investment approach, client service, and portfolio performance.",
        "start_character": 3360,
        "end_character": 3582
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to grow our business by expanding our product offerings.",
        "start_character": 32477,
        "end_character": 32541
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We primarily focus on acquiring equity stakes in, and providing debt financing to, large, multi-product private equity and private credit firms, which we may refer to as “GPs” or “Partner Managers.” Our GP Strategic Capital division also houses our Business Services Platform (“BSP”), which provides strategic support to our Partner Managers.",
        "start_character": 14956,
        "end_character": 15298
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001823945-26-000009",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001823945-26-000009-fa4172254121c379",
        "accession_number": "0001823945-26-000009",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide investment advisory services through several entities that are registered as investment advisers with the SEC pursuant to the Investment Advisers Act of 1940, as amended (the “Advisers Act”).",
